Test data of TestRegexpShiki (lib/regexpv_test.go)

regexps.json holds the regexps that the JavaScript engine of shiki 4.5.0
(MIT) makes from the TextMate grammars that @shikijs/langs 4.5.0 ships, from
tm-grammars 1.32.22, to highlight input.md. record.mjs recorded them. The
patterns are made from these grammars:

- bash (shellscript), css, go, html, json and typescript: the grammars of
  Visual Studio Code, under the MIT license below.
- yaml: textmate/yaml.tmbundle at e54ceae, under its license below.

input.md holds the code blocks of the journal posts of tifa's example shop
(github.com/liustack/tifa, MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Leon Liu).

record.mjs was written for this repository, under its MIT license
(LICENSE-MIT at the root).

